The rainbow trout (Oncorhynchus mykiss) is a species of trout native to cold-water tributaries of the Pacific Ocean in North America and Asia. The steelhead (sometimes called steelhead trout) is an anadromous (sea-run) form of the coastal rainbow trout (O. m. irideus) or Columbia River redband trout (O. m. gairdneri) that usually returns to freshwater to spawn after living two to three years in the ocean."}, "member_count": 8, "cross_references": [{"found_name": "ferro", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 592, "target_cluster_name": "ferro", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Steel is an alloy of iron and carbon, a common metallurgical relationship.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "reverse: Steel is an alloy of iron and carbon, a common metallurgical relationship.", "is_reverse": true}]}, {"canonical_name": "Tree", "category": "PLANT", "subcategory": "OTHER_PLANT", "book_count": 9, "total_mentions": 52, "members": [{"entity_id": "tree", "book_id": "english_physician_1652", "name": "Tree", "category": "PLANT", "subcategory": "OTHER_PLANT", "count": 11, "variants": ["Tree", "Trees"], "contexts": ["plant associated with the sun", "description of Birch-Tree"]}, {"entity_id": "tree", "book_id": "principles_of_psychology_james_1890", "name": "tree", "category": "PLANT", "subcategory": "OTHER_PLANT", "count": 4, "variants": ["tree"], "contexts": ["woody perennial plant", "large woody plant"]}, {"entity_id": "arbusto", "book_id": "coloquios_da_orta_1563", "name": "arbusto", "category": "PLANT", "subcategory": "OTHER_PLANT", "count": 1, "variants": ["arbusto"], "contexts": ["type of plant"]}, {"entity_id": "árvore", "book_id": "coloquios_da_orta_1563", "name": "árvore", "category": "PLANT", "subcategory": "OTHER_PLANT", "count": 1, "variants": ["árvore"], "contexts": ["source of incense"]}, {"entity_id": "tree", "book_id": "kosmos_humboldt_1845", "name": "tree", "category": 