o", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 98, "target_cluster_name": "Theophrasto", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Both were highly influential ancient writers on materia medica and botany, whose works were foundational for later medical and herbal traditions.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "reverse: Both were highly influential ancient writers on materia medica and botany, whose works were foundational for later medical and herbal traditions.", "is_reverse": true}, {"found_name": "Author", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 130, "target_cluster_name": "Author", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Dioscorides was an ancient author whose work on materia medica was a primary source for botanical and pharmacological knowledge in premodern times.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "reverse: Dioscorides was an ancient author whose work on materia medica was a primary source for botanical and pharmacological knowledge in premodern times.", "is_reverse": true}, {"found_name": "Riverius", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 199, "target_cluster_name": "Riverius", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Dioscorides was a foundational figure in pharmacology and botany, whose work on materia medica was essential for physicians like Riverius who relied on herbal remedies.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "reverse: Dioscorides was a foundational figure in pharmacology and botany, whose work on materia medica was essential for physicians like Riverius who relied on herbal remedies.", "is_reverse": true}, {"found_name": "Mathiolus", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 252, "target_cluster_name": "Mathiolus", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Mattioli is famous for his commentaries on Dioscorides' De Materia Medica, a foundational text in ancient pharmacology. His work significantly expanded and interpreted Dioscorides' original writings for a Renaissance audience.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "reverse: Mattioli is famous for his commentaries on Dioscorides' De Materia Medica, a foundational text in ancient pharmacology. His work significantly expanded and interpreted Dioscorides' original writings for a Renaissance audience.", "is_reverse": true}, {"found_name": "Hercules", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 495, "target_cluster_name": "Hercules", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Dioscorides was a Greek physician and botanist whose work on materia medica was influential. Hercules, as a figure of myth and legend, is often associated with feats of strength and overcoming challenges, which could indirectly relate to the pursuit of health and well-being that physicians like Dioscorides addressed.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "reverse: Dioscorides was a Greek physician and botanist whose work on materia medica was influential. Hercules, as a figure of myth and legend, is often associated with feats of strength and overcoming challenges, which could indirectly relate to the pursuit of health and well-being that physicians like Dioscorides addressed.", "is_reverse": true}, {"found_name": "Paulus Ægineta", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 586, "target_cluster_name": "Paulus Ægineta", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Both were influential medical writers of antiquity, with Dioscorides focusing on materia medica and Paulus of Aegina on surgery and general medicine.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "reverse: Both were influential medical writers of a