ty of China.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "reverse: Beijing is the capital city of China.", "is_reverse": true}, {"found_name": "sciati", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 1501, "target_cluster_name": "Ciatica", "source_book": "historia_medicinal_monardes_1574", "evidence_snippet": "medades uFccrds,desháterofódone anribuos, quicalos do Tf lores delas juncturas,que llaman gota artherica, y agua dela aró qualquier gengso de gora, que eſté en parte, China: — omienibto particular, en", "confidence": 0.65, "auto_label": "subtype_relation", "found_relationship": "type of pain"}, {"found_name": "qerfah", "link_type": "cross_linguistic", "link_strength": 0.9, "target_cluster_id": null, "target_cluster_name": null, "source_book": "coloquios_da_orta_1563", "evidence_snippet": "É um dos mais frequentes entre os Árabes, £93 qerfah, e significa casca (cor^ tex em Freytag). Chamam á canella, qerfah ed-darsini, a casca do pau da China, ou simplesmente qerfah, a casca por excelle", "confidence": 0.65, "auto_label": "cross_linguistic", "found_relationship": "Arabic for bark"}, {"found_name": "qerfah ed-darsini", "link_type": "cross_linguistic", "link_strength": 0.9, "target_cluster_id": null, "target_cluster_name": null, "source_book": "coloquios_da_orta_1563", "evidence_snippet": "É um dos mais frequentes entre os Árabes, £93 qerfah, e significa casca (cor^ tex em Freytag). Chamam á canella, qerfah ed-darsini, a casca do pau da China, ou simplesmente qerfah, a casca por excelle", "confidence": 0.65, "auto_label": "cross_linguistic", "found_relationship": "Arabic for bark of the China tree"}, {"found_name": "camfora de pães", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": null, "target_cluster_name": null, "source_book": "coloquios_da_orta_1563", "evidence_snippet": "ocasionalmente acontecida: e a esta causa chamão os fílosofos causa sem a qual não se acontece o efe