 Neolithic onward, chiefly the Celts, and Germanic tribes inhabiting the north."}, "member_count": 11, "cross_references": [{"found_name": "Central Europe", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 2214, "target_cluster_name": "Central Europe", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Germany is a prominent country located within Central Europe.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Germany is a prominent country located within Central Europe."}, {"found_name": "Europe", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 30, "target_cluster_name": "Europe", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Germany is a country situated in Europe.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Germany is a country situated in Europe."}, {"found_name": "Bavaria", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 2961, "target_cluster_name": "Bavaria", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Bavaria is a state within Germany.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Bavaria is a state within Germany."}, {"found_name": "Berlin", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 267, "target_cluster_name": "Berlin", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Berlin is the capital city of Germany.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Berlin is the capital city of Germany."}, {"found_name": "Alps", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 285, "target_cluster_name": "Alpes", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "The Alps mountain range forms a southern border for Germany.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "The Alps mountain range forms a southern border for Germany."}, {"found_name": "Belgique", "l