of four major islands alongside 14,121 smaller islands. Japan is divided into 47 administrative prefectures and eight traditional regions, and around 75% of its terrain is mountainous and heavily forested, concentrating its agriculture and highly urbanized population along its eastern coastal plains. With a population of almost 123 million as of 2026, it is the world's 11th most populous country. Tokyo is the country's capital and largest city."}, "cross_references": [{"found_name": "East Asia", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 737, "target_cluster_name": "Asie orientale", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Japan is located in East Asia.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Japan is located in East Asia."}, {"found_name": "Asia", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 231, "target_cluster_name": "Asie", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Japan is a country on the continent of Asia.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Japan is a country on the continent of Asia."}, {"found_name": "Pacific Ocean", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 570, "target_cluster_name": "Mer du Sud", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Japan is located in the Pacific Ocean.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Japan is located in the Pacific Ocean."}, {"found_name": "Oriente", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 1590, "target_cluster_name": "Oriente", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Japan is a region historically considered part of the 'Eastern world'.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "reverse: Japan is a region historically considered part of the 'Eastern world'.", "is_reverse": true}]}, {"canonical_name": 