papyrus, dated from circa 1650 BCE."}, "cross_references": [{"found_name": "Arithmetic", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 1207, "target_cluster_name": "Arithmetica", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Arithmetic is a fundamental branch of mathematics, dealing with numbers and their operations. Historical texts often discuss arithmetic as a core component or precursor to broader mathematical study.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Arithmetic is a fundamental branch of mathematics, dealing with numbers and their operations. Historical texts often discuss arithmetic as a core component or precursor to broader mathematical study."}, {"found_name": "Calculation", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 1380, "target_cluster_name": "calculation", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Calculation is the process of computing or determining a numerical result, a core activity within mathematics.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Calculation is the process of computing or determining a numerical result, a core activity within mathematics."}, {"found_name": "Circle", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 334, "target_cluster_name": "circle", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "The circle is a fundamental geometric shape, and its properties and calculations are central to geometry, a major branch of mathematics.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "The circle is a fundamental geometric shape, and its properties and calculations are central to geometry, a major branch of mathematics."}, {"found_name": "Cognition", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 656, "target_cluster_name": "cognition", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Mathematic