n and contact with cold masses; it forms a substance known as trap or basalt—a substance that", "confidence": 0.65, "auto_label": "true_synonym", "found_relationship": "a substance also known as trap"}, {"found_name": "trap", "link_type": "same_referent", "link_strength": 1.0, "target_cluster_id": null, "target_cluster_name": null, "source_book": "first_principles_spencer_1862", "evidence_snippet": "of the molten nucleus is extruded; and when this is cooled with comparative rapidity, through free radiation and contact with cold masses; it forms a substance known as trap or basalt—a substance that", "confidence": 0.65, "auto_label": "true_synonym", "found_relationship": "a substance also known as basalt"}]}, {"canonical_name": "strata", "category": "SUBSTANCE", "subcategory": "OTHER_SUBSTANCE", "book_count": 4, "total_mentions": 16, "members": [{"entity_id": "tertiary_strata", "book_id": "origin_of_species_darwin_1859", "name": "tertiary strata", "category": "SUBSTANCE", "subcategory": "OTHER_SUBSTANCE", "count": 2, "variants": ["tertiary strata", "Tertiary strata"], "contexts": ["geological rock layer", "geological layers on islands"]}, {"entity_id": "stratum", "book_id": "origin_of_species_darwin_1859", "name": "stratum", "category": "SUBSTANCE", "subcategory": "OTHER_SUBSTANCE", "count": 1, "variants": ["stratum"], "contexts": ["layer of rock or soil"]}, {"entity_id": "secondary_strata", "book_id": "origin_of_species_darwin_1859", "name": "Secondary strata", "category": "SUBSTANCE", "subcategory": "OTHER_SUBSTANCE", "count": 1, "variants": ["Secondary strata"], "contexts": ["geological rock layer"]}, {"entity_id": "strata", "book_id": "kosmos_humboldt_1845", "name": "strata", "category": "SUBSTANCE", "subcategory": "OTHER_SUBSTANCE", "count": 5, "variants": ["strata"], "contexts": ["fossiliferous layers, vertical arrangement", "layers of rock"]}, {"entity_id": "strata", "book_id": "first_principles_spencer_1862", "name": "strata", "category": "SUBSTANCE", "subcate