5\" in decimal means two hundreds, no tens, and five ones. The same principle applies in place-value notations that uses a base other than ten, such as binary and hexadecimal."}, "cross_references": [{"found_name": "Affection", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 3559, "target_cluster_name": "affection", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Love is a primary form of affection, often considered its most intense manifestation.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Love is a primary form of affection, often considered its most intense manifestation."}, {"found_name": "passion", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 1042, "target_cluster_name": "passion", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "While 'love' is not in the candidate list, 'passion' is frequently used to describe an intense form of love or romantic desire.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "reverse: While 'love' is not in the candidate list, 'passion' is frequently used to describe an intense form of love or romantic desire.", "is_reverse": true}, {"found_name": "OYL Olive", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 1882, "target_cluster_name": "azeite", "source_book": "english_physician_1652", "evidence_snippet": "Dis∣case. Chap. 5. Of Oyles. 1. OYL Olive, which is commonly known by the name of Sallet Oyl, I suppose because it is usually eaten with Sallets by them that love it; If it be pressed out of ripe Oliv", "confidence": 0.65, "auto_label": "subtype_relation", "found_relationship": "type of Oyl"}]}, {"canonical_name": "philosopher", "category": "PERSON", "subcategory": "OTHER_PERSON", "book_count": 4, "total_mentions": 9, "members": [{"entity_id": "philosopher", "book_id": "pseudodoxia_epidemica_browne_1646", "name": "Philosopher", "category": "PERSON", "subcategory": "OTHER_PERSON