 aircraft, the AT-24 crew trainer, and the United States Marine Corps' PBJ-1 patrol bomber."}, "member_count": 5, "cross_references": [{"found_name": "Central America", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 1339, "target_cluster_name": "Central America", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Central America is geographically and culturally linked to North America.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Central America is geographically and culturally linked to North America."}, {"found_name": "Equatorial America", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 1437, "target_cluster_name": "equatorial America", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Equatorial America is a region that borders and is closely associated with North America.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Equatorial America is a region that borders and is closely associated with North America."}, {"found_name": "Canada", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 736, "target_cluster_name": "Canada", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Canada is a country in North America.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "reverse: Canada is a country in North America.", "is_reverse": true}, {"found_name": "Newfoundland", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 1039, "target_cluster_name": "Newfoundland", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Newfoundland and Labrador is a region within North America.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "reverse: Newfoundland and Labrador is a region within North America.", "is_reverse": true}, {"found_name": "lakes", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 1350, "target_cluster_name": "lakes", "s