izome bearing fronds at intervals along its length. The species differ in size and general appearance and in the character of the fronds, which are evergreen, persisting for 1–2 years, pinnate or pinnatifid (rarely simple entire), and from 10 to 80 cm or more long."}, "cross_references": [{"found_name": "epithimo", "link_type": "same_referent", "link_strength": 1.0, "target_cluster_id": 616, "target_cluster_name": "epithimo", "source_book": "ricettario_fiorentino_1597", "evidence_snippet": "Cartamo fcorticato j^y.* Et ancora conaltrcmedici ne purganti fecondo che tor- na comodo al Medico , che l'ordina, cioè ò con loelleba ro nerojó con I epitimo,© col polipodio : & fecondo alcuni fi com", "confidence": 0.65, "auto_label": "true_synonym", "found_relationship": "reverse: synonym", "is_reverse": true}, {"found_name": "Fern", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 994, "target_cluster_name": "Fern", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Polypody is a genus of ferns.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Polypody is a genus of ferns."}, {"found_name": "Maidenhair Fern", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 788, "target_cluster_name": "avenca", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Maidenhair Fern is a type of fern, and Polypody is a genus of ferns.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Maidenhair Fern is a type of fern, and Polypody is a genus of ferns."}, {"found_name": "mosses", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 2317, "target_cluster_name": "mosses", "source_book": "pseudodoxia_epidemica_browne_1646", "evidence_snippet": "shape, and maintains a regular figure; like other supercrescences, and such as living upon the stock of others, are termed parasitical Plants, as Polypody, Moss, the smaller Capillaries, and many more", "confidence": 0.65, "auto