ound on branches and develop into leaves or flowers.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Buds are found on branches and develop into leaves or flowers."}, {"found_name": "Flower", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 150, "target_cluster_name": "flower", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Flowers often grow on branches.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Flowers often grow on branches."}, {"found_name": "Fruit", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 72, "target_cluster_name": "frutas", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Fruits develop from flowers on branches.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Fruits develop from flowers on branches."}, {"found_name": "Shrubs", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 472, "target_cluster_name": "arbustes", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Shrubs have branches, similar to trees but typically smaller.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Shrubs have branches, similar to trees but typically smaller."}, {"found_name": "páo", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 1749, "target_cluster_name": "páo", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Branches are structural parts of woody plants from which wood is derived.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "reverse: Branches are structural parts of woody plants from which wood is derived.", "is_reverse": true}]}, {"canonical_name": "organic being", "category": "CONCEPT", "subcategory": "OTHER_CONCEPT", "book_count": 5, "total_mentions": 18, "members": [{"entity_id": "organic_being", "book_id": "origin_of_species_darwin_1859", "name": "organic being", "category": "CONCEPT", "subcategory":