t basic experiments to understand how things fall to the ground, while teams of scientists may take years of systematic investigation to advance their understanding of a phenomenon. Experiments and other types of hands-on activities are very important to student learning in the science classroom."}, "member_count": 7, "cross_references": [{"found_name": "Loadstone", "link_type": "same_referent", "link_strength": 1.0, "target_cluster_id": 593, "target_cluster_name": "Loadstone", "source_book": "pseudodoxia_epidemica_browne_1646", "evidence_snippet": "Loadstone, and that perhaps we speak not properly, when we say vulgarly and appropriately the Loadstone draweth Iron; and yet herein we should not want experiment and great authority. The words of _Re", "confidence": 0.65, "auto_label": "true_synonym", "found_relationship": "synonym"}, {"found_name": "Calculation", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 1380, "target_cluster_name": "calculation", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Calculation is a fundamental component of performing and analyzing scientific experiments.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Calculation is a fundamental component of performing and analyzing scientific experiments."}, {"found_name": "Experience", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 105, "target_cluster_name": "experience", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Scientific experiments are a direct form of experience used to gain knowledge.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Scientific experiments are a direct form of experience used to gain knowledge."}, {"found_name": "Force", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 59, "target_cluster_name": "Force", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Many scientific experiments investigate the nature and effects of