r something.", "is_reverse": true}, {"found_name": "Prayer", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 1226, "target_cluster_name": "Prayer", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Prayer frequently arises from or expresses desires.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "reverse: Prayer frequently arises from or expresses desires.", "is_reverse": true}, {"found_name": "luxuria", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 1351, "target_cluster_name": "luxuria", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Luxury is often the object of desire, representing things that are wanted but not essential.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "reverse: Luxury is often the object of desire, representing things that are wanted but not essential.", "is_reverse": true}, {"found_name": "stimulus", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 1594, "target_cluster_name": "stimulus", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Desire can be considered a psychological stimulus that motivates action and behavior.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "reverse: Desire can be considered a psychological stimulus that motivates action and behavior.", "is_reverse": true}, {"found_name": "sexual selection", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 1841, "target_cluster_name": "sexual selection", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Sexual selection is fundamentally linked to reproductive drives and desires.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "reverse: Sexual selection is fundamentally linked to reproductive drives and desires.", "is_reverse": true}, {"found_name": "interest", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 1991, "target