the geographical distribution and environment of organisms.", "is_reverse": true}, {"found_name": "geography of plants", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 2598, "target_cluster_name": "geography of plants", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Biogeography is a sub-discipline of geography, specifically focusing on the spatial distribution of living organisms. The relationship is one of a specific field within a broader discipline.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "reverse: Biogeography is a sub-discipline of geography, specifically focusing on the spatial distribution of living organisms. The relationship is one of a specific field within a broader discipline.", "is_reverse": true}, {"found_name": "physical geography", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 1947, "target_cluster_name": "physical geography", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Physical geography is a major branch of geography.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "reverse: Physical geography is a major branch of geography.", "is_reverse": true}, {"found_name": "Essai polit, sur la Nouvelle-Espagne", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 2764, "target_cluster_name": "Essai polit, sur la Nouvelle-Espagne", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "The 'Political Essay on the Kingdom of New Spain' is a foundational work in the field of geography, specifically focusing on the political and economic geography of a region. The candidate 'Geography' represents the broader academic discipline to which this essay belongs.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "reverse: The 'Political Essay on the Kingdom of New Spain' is a foundational work in the field of geography, specifically focusing on the political and economic geography of a reg