tem but dying down to the root each year\"; \"BOTANY Resembling a leaf in colour or texture."}, "cross_references": [{"found_name": "Beans", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 1063, "target_cluster_name": "Beans", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "The description states that bananas grow on large treelike herbaceous flowering plants.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "reverse: The description states that bananas grow on large treelike herbaceous flowering plants.", "is_reverse": true}, {"found_name": "Plants", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 16, "target_cluster_name": "Plants", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Herbaceous plants are a subcategory of Plants.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Herbaceous plants are a subcategory of Plants."}, {"found_name": "Flowering plants", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 2985, "target_cluster_name": "flowering plants", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Herbaceous plants are a type of flowering plant.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Herbaceous plants are a type of flowering plant."}, {"found_name": "Vegetables", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 3853, "target_cluster_name": "Vegetables", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Many herbaceous plants are cultivated as vegetables.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Many herbaceous plants are cultivated as vegetables."}, {"found_name": "Shrubs", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 472, "target_cluster_name": "arbustes", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Herbaceous plants are distinguished from shrubs by their lack of persist