d the 'father of geometry' and his work 'Elements' is a cornerstone of mathematical education and thought.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Euclid is considered the 'father of geometry' and his work 'Elements' is a cornerstone of mathematical education and thought."}, {"found_name": "Gottfried Wilhelm Leibniz", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 859, "target_cluster_name": "Leibnitz", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Leibniz was a prominent mathematician and philosopher who independently developed calculus.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Leibniz was a prominent mathematician and philosopher who independently developed calculus."}, {"found_name": "Isaac Newton", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 71, "target_cluster_name": "Newton", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Newton was a pivotal figure in mathematics and physics, credited with developing calculus and fundamental laws of motion and gravitation.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Newton was a pivotal figure in mathematics and physics, credited with developing calculus and fundamental laws of motion and gravitation."}, {"found_name": "Johannes Kepler", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 695, "target_cluster_name": "Kepler", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Kepler was a mathematician and astronomer known for his laws of planetary motion, which involved significant mathematical calculations.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Kepler was a mathematician and astronomer known for his laws of planetary motion, which involved significant mathematical calculations."}, {"found_name": "Pierre-Simon Laplace", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluste