ist whose work, like Vesalius', contributed to the advancement of anatomical knowledge during the Renaissance."}, {"found_name": "Anatomist", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 3760, "target_cluster_name": "Anatomicos", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Andreas Vesalius is one of the most famous anatomists in history, and this term broadly categorizes individuals in his field.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Andreas Vesalius is one of the most famous anatomists in history, and this term broadly categorizes individuals in his field."}, {"found_name": "Anatomicos", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 3760, "target_cluster_name": "Anatomicos", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Anatomicos is a Greek term for anatomist, a field in which Andreas Vesalius was a preeminent figure.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Anatomicos is a Greek term for anatomist, a field in which Andreas Vesalius was a preeminent figure."}, {"found_name": "Galen", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 29, "target_cluster_name": "Galen", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Andreas Vesalius's anatomical work, particularly 'De humani corporis fabrica', was a direct challenge and correction to the long-held anatomical theories of Galen.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Andreas Vesalius's anatomical work, particularly 'De humani corporis fabrica', was a direct challenge and correction to the long-held anatomical theories of Galen."}, {"found_name": "Girolamo Mercuriale", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 622, "target_cluster_name": "Mercurial", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Girolamo Mercuriale was a prominent physician and medical historian