ecific type of chemical reaction where a single compound separates into two or more simpler substances. Chemical reactions are the broader category.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "reverse: Chemical decomposition is a specific type of chemical reaction where a single compound separates into two or more simpler substances. Chemical reactions are the broader category.", "is_reverse": true}, {"found_name": "chimie végétale", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 1358, "target_cluster_name": "chimie végétale", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Organic chemistry studies the reactions of organic compounds.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "reverse: Organic chemistry studies the reactions of organic compounds.", "is_reverse": true}, {"found_name": "Combustion", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 866, "target_cluster_name": "combustion", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Combustion is a specific and historically significant type of chemical reaction.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Combustion is a specific and historically significant type of chemical reaction."}, {"found_name": "Decomposition", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 2085, "target_cluster_name": "decomposition", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Decomposition is a specific type of chemical reaction where a compound breaks down into simpler substances.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Decomposition is a specific type of chemical reaction where a compound breaks down into simpler substances."}, {"found_name": "Conservation of Mass", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 3778, "target_cluster_name": "indestructibility of Matter", "so