es with historical eruptions, and there are likely to be many large eruptions that have not been identified.", "wikipedia_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_volcanic_eruptions_1500–2000"}, "cross_references": [{"found_name": "Antisana", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 1867, "target_cluster_name": "Antisana", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Antisana is a volcano in Ecuador, and Jorullo is a volcano in Mexico. Both are notable volcanoes in the Americas that experienced significant eruptions.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Antisana is a volcano in Ecuador, and Jorullo is a volcano in Mexico. Both are notable volcanoes in the Americas that experienced significant eruptions."}, {"found_name": "Chimborazo", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 708, "target_cluster_name": "Chimborazo", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Chimborazo is a volcano in Ecuador, and Jorullo is a volcano in Mexico. Both are notable volcanoes in the Americas that experienced significant eruptions.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Chimborazo is a volcano in Ecuador, and Jorullo is a volcano in Mexico. Both are notable volcanoes in the Americas that experienced significant eruptions."}, {"found_name": "Colima", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 1449, "target_cluster_name": "Colima", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Colima is a volcano in Mexico, and Jorullo is a volcano in Mexico. Both are notable volcanoes in the same region that experienced significant eruptions.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Colima is a volcano in Mexico, and Jorullo is a volcano in Mexico. Both are notable volcanoes in the same region that experienced significant eruptions."}, {"found_name": "Cotopaxi", "lin