onal work on electromagnetism, including Ampère's law."}, {"found_name": "Hans Christian Ørsted", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 2447, "target_cluster_name": "Oersted", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Ørsted's discovery of the relationship between electricity and magnetism (electromagnetism) directly inspired Ampère's subsequent theoretical and experimental work in the same field.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Ørsted's discovery of the relationship between electricity and magnetism (electromagnetism) directly inspired Ampère's subsequent theoretical and experimental work in the same field."}, {"found_name": "Jean-Baptiste Biot", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 723, "target_cluster_name": "Biot", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Biot was a contemporary physicist and mathematician who collaborated with and was influenced by Ampère's work on electromagnetism. They engaged in scientific correspondence and their research areas overlapped significantly.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Biot was a contemporary physicist and mathematician who collaborated with and was influenced by Ampère's work on electromagnetism. They engaged in scientific correspondence and their research areas overlapped significantly."}, {"found_name": "Oersted", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 2447, "target_cluster_name": "Oersted", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Both were prominent physicists who made significant contributions to electromagnetism. Ampère's work on the mathematical and experimental laws of electromagnetism is foundational, and Oersted's discovery of electromagnetism was a crucial precursor.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "reverse: Both were prominent physicists