n", "birth_year": 1801, "death_year": 1832, "description": "French botanist and traveler; discovered Costus speciosus in Goa.", "note": "The text 'coloquios_da_orta_1563' is likely a misattribution or an error, as Victor Jacquemont lived much later than 1563. His association with the Costus plant is well-documented."}, "cross_references": []}, {"canonical_name": "intellectual development", "category": "CONCEPT", "subcategory": "OTHER_CONCEPT", "book_count": 2, "total_mentions": 3, "members": [{"entity_id": "intellectual_development", "book_id": "kosmos_humboldt_1845", "name": "intellectual development", "category": "CONCEPT", "subcategory": "OTHER_CONCEPT", "count": 2, "variants": ["intellectual development"], "contexts": ["human development influenced by language", "growth of mental abilities"]}, {"entity_id": "intellectual_development", "book_id": "first_principles_spencer_1862", "name": "intellectual development", "category": "CONCEPT", "subcategory": "OTHER_CONCEPT", "count": 1, "variants": ["intellectual development"], "contexts": ["advancement of cognitive abilities"]}], "edges": [{"source_book": "kosmos_humboldt_1845", "source_name": "intellectual development", "target_book": "first_principles_spencer_1862", "target_name": "intellectual development", "similarity": 1.0}], "id": 3589, "stable_key": "clu_c1d6e4c54f2fab6a", "ground_truth": {"modern_name": "Intellectual development", "confidence": "high", "type": "concept"}, "cross_references": [{"found_name": "mental evolution", "link_type": "same_referent", "link_strength": 1.0, "target_cluster_id": 2426, "target_cluster_name": "mental evolution", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Both 'Mental evolution' and 'Intellectual development' describe the progression and growth of mental faculties and understanding over time.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_synonyms", "found_relationship": "reverse: Both 'Mental evolution' and 'Intellectual development' describe the progression and growth of 