o give speeches and host rallies by the likes of Mohandas Gandhi and Muhammad Ali Jinnah. There have also been battles taken place there such as the Muharram Rebellion. During the rule of Mughal emperor Aurangzeb, Farhad Khan was appointed as the faujdar of Sylhet. Farhad Khan supervised the construction of the Shahi Eidgah on a hill in the 17th century.", "wikipedia_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sylhet_Shahi_Eidgah"}, "cross_references": [{"found_name": "Paranema cyathoides", "link_type": "same_referent", "link_strength": 1.0, "target_cluster_id": null, "target_cluster_name": null, "source_book": "kosmos_humboldt_1845", "evidence_snippet": "(of which a stem 48 feet long has been in the possession of the British Museum since 1831), does not grow in Nepaul, but is found on the mountains of Silhet, to the northwest of Calcutta, in lat. 24 d", "confidence": 0.65, "auto_label": "true_synonym", "found_relationship": "synonym"}, {"found_name": "Sphaeroptera barbata", "link_type": "same_referent", "link_strength": 1.0, "target_cluster_id": null, "target_cluster_name": null, "source_book": "kosmos_humboldt_1845", "evidence_snippet": "(of which a stem 48 feet long has been in the possession of the British Museum since 1831), does not grow in Nepaul, but is found on the mountains of Silhet, to the northwest of Calcutta, in lat. 24 d", "confidence": 0.65, "auto_label": "true_synonym", "found_relationship": "synonym"}]}, {"canonical_name": "ribes", "category": "PLANT", "subcategory": "OTHER_PLANT", "book_count": 2, "total_mentions": 3, "members": [{"entity_id": "ribes", "book_id": "kosmos_humboldt_1845", "name": "Ribes", "category": "PLANT", "subcategory": "OTHER_PLANT", "count": 1, "variants": ["Ribes"], "contexts": ["genus of prickly plants"]}, {"entity_id": "ribes", "book_id": "ricettario_fiorentino_1597", "name": "ribes", "category": "PLANT", "subcategory": "OTHER_PLANT", "count": 2, "variants": ["ribes", "RIBES"], "contexts": ["a plant, likely currant", "plant with 