"Often produced alongside light, and sometimes considered a form of energy related to light."}, {"found_name": "Caloric Theory", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 491, "target_cluster_name": "caloric", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Historical theories of heat often discussed its relationship to light and other forms of energy.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "Historical theories of heat often discussed its relationship to light and other forms of energy."}, {"found_name": "Luminiferous Aether", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 1472, "target_cluster_name": "ethereal fluid", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "A hypothetical medium once thought to transmit light.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "A hypothetical medium once thought to transmit light."}, {"found_name": "Stars", "link_type": "conceptual_overlap", "link_strength": 0.5, "target_cluster_id": 2672, "target_cluster_name": "Stars", "source_book": "llm_generated", "evidence_snippet": "Stars are a primary source of light in the night sky.", "confidence": 0.85, "auto_label": "llm_related", "found_relationship": "reverse: Stars are a primary source of light in the night sky.", "is_reverse": true}]}, {"canonical_name": "Rule", "category": "CONCEPT", "subcategory": "OTHER_CONCEPT", "book_count": 2, "total_mentions": 2, "members": [{"entity_id": "rule", "book_id": "pseudodoxia_epidemica_browne_1646", "name": "Rule", "category": "CONCEPT", "subcategory": "OTHER_CONCEPT", "count": 1, "variants": ["Rule"], "contexts": ["principle or standard"]}, {"entity_id": "rule", "book_id": "kosmos_humboldt_1845", "name": "rule", "category": "CONCEPT", "subcategory": "OTHER_CONCEPT", "count": 1, "variants": ["rule"], "contexts": ["general principle"]}], "edges": [{"source_book": "pseudodoxia_epidemica_browne_1646", "source_nam